            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The results of the study performed on 119 male coronary patients and invalids aged 30-59 showed that the additional use of therapeutic exercise in rehabilitation of relevant patients calls for consideration of personality traits and valid judgment on the patient's condition and ways of its correction.</AbstractText>
